#. type: Title #
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting an inventory tool"
msgstr "Ansluta ett inventarieprogram"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"A walkthrough for the developers of a program that prints labels through the "
"print server, here an inventory tool that prints asset labels: one label, a "
"series of labels in one request, following the job, printing again after a "
"jam, and handling errors. Every request is described in the [API reference]"
"(api.md); setting up the server in [Server installation](server-install.md)."
msgstr ""
"En genomgång för utvecklare av program som skriver ut etiketter via "
"utskriftsservern, här ett inventarieprogram som skriver ut "
"inventarieetiketter: en etikett, en serie etiketter i en och samma "
"förfrågan, att följa jobbet, att skriva ut igen efter ett papperskrock och "
"att hantera fel. Varje förfrågan beskrivs i [API-referensen](api.md); hur "
"servern installeras beskrivs i [Serverinstallation](server-install.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The setup { #setup }"
msgstr "Förutsättningarna { #setup }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid "The examples use these names; yours will differ:"
msgstr "Exemplen använder dessa namn; dina egna blir andra:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The server: `https://labels.example.com/api/v1`, reached through the "
"company's reverse proxy."
msgstr ""
"Servern: `https://labels.example.com/api/v1`, nåbar via företagets omvända "
"proxy."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The label `asset-tag.tavletta` in the labels folder, designed in the "
"Tavletta app, with a QR code and a text that both contain the placeholder "
"`{AssetNumber}`."
msgstr ""
"Etiketten `asset-tag.tavletta` i etikettmappen, utformad i Tavletta-appen, "
"med en QR-kod och en text som båda innehåller platshållaren `{AssetNumber}`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The printer `it-cab` of `printers.toml`: a cab label printer with thermal "
"transfer (`method = \"transfer\"`), printing turned by 180 degrees "
"(`upside_down = true`)."
msgstr ""
"Skrivaren `it-cab` i `printers.toml`: en cab-etikettskrivare med "
"termotransfer (`method = \"transfer\"`), som skriver ut vänd 180 grader "
"(`upside_down = true`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"An access token with the role `print`, limited to `it-cab`, made by the "
"server's administrator:"
msgstr ""
"En åtkomsttoken med rollen `print`, begränsad till `it-cab`, skapad av "
"serverns administratör:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  tavletta token new inventory-tool --role print --printer it-cab \\\n"
"      --tokens tokens.toml --printers printers.toml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"Keep the token in the tool's secret store (configuration encrypted, a "
"vault), not in the code. In the shell examples:"
msgstr ""
"Förvara token i programmets hemlighetslager (krypterad konfiguration, ett "
"valv), inte i koden. I skalexemplen:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"TAVLETTA=https://labels.example.com/api/v1\n"
"TOKEN=tav_3f9c0a1b2c4d_Xq2…\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. What the label needs { #describe }"
msgstr "1. Vad etiketten behöver { #describe }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \"$TAVLETTA/labels/asset-tag\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The answer lists the label's `columns` (here `[\"AssetNumber\"]`): every "
"data row needs these keys. A placeholder without a value in the row refuses "
"the print with 422 `label_unprintable` (\"No such column\"), so a label "
"never prints a half-empty text."
msgstr ""
"Svaret listar etikettens `columns` (här `[\"AssetNumber\"]`): varje datarad "
"behöver dessa nycklar. En platshållare utan värde i raden gör att utskriften "
"avvisas med 422 `label_unprintable` (\"No such column\"), så en etikett "
"skriver aldrig ut en halvtom text."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Preview { #preview }"
msgstr "2. Förhandsgranskning { #preview }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"A preview prints nothing and returns the label as a PNG image, for example "
"to show it in the tool before printing:"
msgstr ""
"En förhandsgranskning skriver inte ut något utan returnerar etiketten som en "
"PNG-bild, till exempel för att visa den i programmet före utskrift:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}]}' \\\n"
"     -o preview.png \"$TAVLETTA/preview\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"With `\"format\": \"json\"` the answer is JSON with the image in base64 and "
"the `warnings` (for example `font_missing`, `barcode_narrow`)."
msgstr ""
"Med `\"format\": \"json\"` är svaret JSON med bilden i base64 och "
"varningarna, `warnings` (till exempel `font_missing`, `barcode_narrow`)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"`\"view\": \"printer\"` shows the image as the printer gets it (turned)."
msgstr "`\"view\": \"printer\"` visar bilden så som skrivaren får den (vänd)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"`other_labels_loaded` in the `warnings`: the printer has other labels loaded "
"than the label's (another size, or another label distance measured). Load "
"the matching roll, or check the label's size and gap.  The printer's latest "
"answer counts if it is of the last minute (after an error nothing is known); "
"a printer the server knows nothing of yet is waited for up to a second after "
"the label is rendered, and one that does not answer by then gives no such "
"warning."
msgstr ""
"`other_labels_loaded` i `warnings`: skrivaren har andra etiketter laddade än "
"etikettens (en annan storlek, eller ett annat uppmätt etikettavstånd). Ladda "
"rätt rulle eller kontrollera etikettens storlek och mellanrum. Skrivarens "
"senaste svar gäller om det är från den senaste minuten (efter ett fel är "
"ingenting känt); en skrivare som servern ännu inte känner till väntar den på "
"i upp till en sekund efter att etiketten har renderats, och om den inte "
"svarar då ges ingen sådan varning."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid "A preview needs only the role `preview`."
msgstr "En förhandsgranskning kräver bara rollen `preview`."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Print one label { #one }"
msgstr "3. Skriva ut en etikett { #one }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}], \"wait\": 30}' \\\n"
"     \"$TAVLETTA/print\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The server checks the request, queues a job for the printer and answers with "
"the job. With `\"wait\": 30` it waits up to 30 seconds for the job: 200 with "
"`\"state\": \"done\"` once printed, else 202 with the job still `queued` or "
"`printing`."
msgstr ""
"Servern kontrollerar förfrågan, köar ett jobb för skrivaren och svarar med "
"jobbet. Med `\"wait\": 30` väntar den upp till 30 sekunder på jobbet: 200 "
"med `\"state\": \"done\"` när det är utskrivet, annars 202 med jobbet "
"fortfarande `queued` eller `printing`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The answer's `Location` header and the job's `id` lead to `GET /api/v1/jobs/"
"{id}`."
msgstr ""
"Svarets `Location`-huvud och jobbets `id` leder till `GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"Each printer prints one job after the other; jobs of different printers run "
"side by side."
msgstr ""
"Varje skrivare skriver ut ett jobb i taget; jobb för olika skrivare körs "
"parallellt."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The job prints despite its `warnings`; `other_labels_loaded` is replaced by "
"what the printer reports when the job prints."
msgstr ""
"Jobbet skrivs ut trots sina `warnings`; `other_labels_loaded` ersätts av det "
"skrivaren rapporterar när jobbet skrivs ut."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. A series in one request { #series }"
msgstr "4. En serie i en förfrågan { #series }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"Twenty asset labels are one request with twenty data rows, not twenty "
"requests: they print as one job, in order, and a problem stops the job at a "
"known row."
msgstr ""
"Tjugo inventarieetiketter är en förfrågan med tjugo datarader, inte tjugo "
"förfrågningar: de skrivs ut som ett jobb, i ordning, och ett problem stoppar "
"jobbet vid en känd rad."

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"wait\": 60,\n"
"          \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}, {\"AssetNumber\": \"100002\"},\n"
"                        {\"AssetNumber\": \"100003\"}, {\"AssetNumber\": \"100020\"}]}' \\\n"
"     \"$TAVLETTA/print\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The recommended pattern: **the tool owns the numbers.** The tool takes the "
"next free asset numbers from its own database, saves them with the assets, "
"and sends them as data rows. The label never counts by itself, so a second "
"server, a restored backup or a reprint can never hand out a number twice."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderade mönstret: **programmet äger numren.** Programmet tar de "
"nästa lediga inventarienumren från sin egen databas, sparar dem tillsammans "
"med tillgångarna och skickar dem som datarader. Etiketten räknar aldrig "
"själv, så en andra server, en återställd säkerhetskopia eller en omutskrift "
"kan aldrig dela ut samma nummer två gånger."

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The alternative: the label's counter { #counter }"
msgstr "Alternativet: etikettens räknare { #counter }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"A label with the variable `{=counter}` (for example `{=counter:000000}` for "
"six digits) counts by itself. The tool can still say where to start:"
msgstr ""
"En etikett med variabeln `{=counter}` (till exempel `{=counter:000000}` för "
"sex siffror) räknar själv. Programmet kan ändå ange var räkningen ska börja:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag-counter\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\",\n"
"          \"counter_start\": 100001, \"copies\": 20, \"no_save_counter\": true}' \\\n"
"     \"$TAVLETTA/print\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"`counter_start` is the first number; the counter goes up with every label "
"and copy: 100001 to 100020."
msgstr ""
"`counter_start` är det första numret; räknaren ökar för varje etikett och "
"kopia: 100001 till 100020."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"`no_save_counter`: the server does not save the next number into the label "
"file. Without it, the label file keeps the next number (100021), and the "
"next print without `counter_start` goes on from there."
msgstr ""
"`no_save_counter`: servern sparar inte nästa nummer i etikettfilen. Utan det "
"behåller etikettfilen nästa nummer (100021), och nästa utskrift utan "
"`counter_start` fortsätter därifrån."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"Use this only when the numbers do not need to be in the tool's database "
"before printing."
msgstr ""
"Använd det här bara när numren inte behöver finnas i programmets databas "
"före utskriften."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Follow the job { #job }"
msgstr "5. Följa jobbet { #job }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \"$TAVLETTA/jobs/$JOB\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `state` | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `queued` | waits for the printer |\n"
"| `waiting` | waits for the label file (another job is saving its counter) |\n"
"| `printing` | is printing; `printed` of `total` labels are out |\n"
"| `done` | all labels printed |\n"
"| `failed` | stopped: `error` says why, `rows_printed` how far it came |\n"
"| `canceled` | canceled |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `state` | Betydelse |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `queued` | väntar på skrivaren |\n"
"| `waiting` | väntar på etikettfilen (ett annat jobb sparar sin räknare) |\n"
"| `printing` | skrivs ut; `printed` av `total` etiketter har kommit ut |\n"
"| `done` | alla etiketter utskrivna |\n"
"| `failed` | stoppat: `error` anger varför, `rows_printed` hur långt det kom |\n"
"| `canceled` | avbrutet |\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"Ask every one or two seconds while the state is not final; the server keeps "
"finished jobs for 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"Fråga var eller varannan sekund så länge tillståndet inte är slutgiltigt; "
"servern behåller färdiga jobb i 24 timmar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"A `print` token sees its own jobs only; another token's job is \"not found\"."
msgstr ""
"En `print`-token ser bara sina egna jobb; en annan tokens jobb är \"hittas "
"inte\"."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. After a jam: print the rest { #reprint }"
msgstr "6. Efter ett papperskrock: skriva ut resten { #reprint }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"When the printer runs out of labels or jams, the job fails, for example:"
msgstr ""
"När skrivaren får slut på etiketter eller papperet kör fast misslyckas "
"jobbet, till exempel:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\"state\": \"failed\", \"printed\": 13, \"total\": 20, \"rows_printed\": 13,\n"
" \"error\": {\"code\": \"printer_out_of_labels\",\n"
"           \"message\": \"… Printing stopped at row 14. To continue, print again from row 14.\"}}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"Once the printer is ready, send the same request again with `rows`, the rows "
"still missing:"
msgstr ""
"När skrivaren är redo skickar du samma förfrågan igen med `rows`, de rader "
"som fortfarande saknas:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"     -d '{\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"printer\": \"it-cab\", \"rows\": \"14-20\",\n"
"          \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": \"100001\"}, {\"AssetNumber\": \"100020\"}]}' \\\n"
"     \"$TAVLETTA/print\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"`rows` counts the data rows from 1: `\"14-20\"`, `\"14-\"` (to the last), "
"`\"5\"`. Send the same data rows as before, so row 14 is the same asset.  A "
"label that was half printed when the printer stopped belongs to the row that "
"failed and is printed again."
msgstr ""
"`rows` räknar datarader från 1: `\"14-20\"`, `\"14-\"` (till den sista), "
"`\"5\"`. Skicka samma datarader som tidigare, så att rad 14 är samma "
"tillgång. En etikett som var halvt utskriven när skrivaren stannade hör till "
"raden som misslyckades och skrivs ut på nytt."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "7. Cancel { #cancel }"
msgstr "7. Avbryta { #cancel }"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -X DELETE -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \"$TAVLETTA/jobs/$JOB\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"A queued job is canceled at once; a printing one stops after the label being "
"printed. A cab printer prints a series in jobs of up to `labels_per_job` "
"labels (250 by default): it stops after the job being printed. 409 "
"`job_finished` if it had finished already."
msgstr ""
"Ett köat jobb avbryts omedelbart; ett som skrivs ut stannar efter etiketten "
"som skrivs ut. En cab-skrivare skriver ut en serie i jobb om högst "
"`labels_per_job` etiketter (som standard 250): den stannar efter jobbet som "
"skrivs ut. 409 `job_finished` om det redan var klart."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "8. Retries and errors { #errors }"
msgstr "8. Nya försök och fel { #errors }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid "`POST /print` is not idempotent: a request sent twice prints twice. So:"
msgstr ""
"`POST /print` är inte idempotent: en förfrågan som skickas två gånger "
"skriver ut två gånger. Därför:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"**Retry automatically** only answers that were refused before a job was "
"made: 503 `busy` and 429 `queue_full`, after a pause that grows (1, 2, 4, 8 "
"s)."
msgstr ""
"**Försök automatiskt igen** endast med svar som avvisades innan något jobb "
"skapades: 503 `busy` och 429 `queue_full`, efter en växande paus (1, 2, 4, 8 "
"s)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"**Do not retry automatically** when the connection broke or timed out after "
"the request was sent: the job may exist and print. Show the operator what "
"happened, let them check the printer, then print the missing labels with "
"`rows`."
msgstr ""
"**Försök inte automatiskt igen** när anslutningen bröts eller tog time-out "
"efter att förfrågan skickats: jobbet kan finnas och skrivas ut. Visa för "
"operatören vad som hände, låt hen kontrollera skrivaren och skriv sedan ut "
"de saknade etiketterna med `rows`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid "**Fix the request** for other 4xx answers; the code says what is wrong:"
msgstr "**Rätta förfrågan** vid andra 4xx-svar; koden anger vad som är fel:"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Code | What the tool does |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `unauthorized` (401) | Token wrong, expired or revoked: ask the administrator for a new one. |\n"
"| `forbidden` (403) | The token's role is too low. |\n"
"| `printer_not_found`, `label_not_found` (404) | Name typed wrong, or the token may not use that printer. |\n"
"| `invalid_field`, `unknown_field` (400) | A bug in the tool: the message names the field. |\n"
"| `too_many_copies` (400), `too_many_labels` (413) | Split the series into several jobs. |\n"
"| `label_unprintable` (422) | The data does not fit the label (a missing column, a code that cannot hold the value): show the message. |\n"
"| `busy` (503), `queue_full` (429) | Retry after a pause. |\n"
"| `printer_<code>` in a failed job | Show the message to the operator; continue with `rows` once fixed. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kod | Vad programmet gör |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `unauthorized` (401) | Token felaktig, utgången eller återkallad: be administratören om en ny. |\n"
"| `forbidden` (403) | Tokens roll är för låg. |\n"
"| `printer_not_found`, `label_not_found` (404) | Namnet felstavat, eller så får token inte använda den skrivaren. |\n"
"| `invalid_field`, `unknown_field` (400) | Ett fel i programmet: meddelandet anger fältet. |\n"
"| `too_many_copies` (400), `too_many_labels` (413) | Dela upp serien i flera jobb. |\n"
"| `label_unprintable` (422) | Data passar inte etiketten (en kolumn saknas, en kod som inte kan rymma värdet): visa meddelandet. |\n"
"| `busy` (503), `queue_full` (429) | Försök igen efter en paus. |\n"
"| `printer_<code>` i ett misslyckat jobb | Visa meddelandet för operatören; fortsätt med `rows` när felet är åtgärdat. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The message (`error.message`) is in the language of `Accept-Language` and "
"meant for people: show it, but decide by the code."
msgstr ""
"Meddelandet (`error.message`) är på språket i `Accept-Language` och är "
"avsett för människor: visa det, men fatta beslut utifrån koden."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Python { #python }"
msgstr "Exempel: Python { #python }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid "With the `requests` package:"
msgstr "Med paketet `requests`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (python)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import os\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"import requests\n"
"\n"
"BASE = os.environ.get(\"TAVLETTA\", \"https://labels.example.com/api/v1\")\n"
"TOKEN = os.environ[\"TAVLETTA_TOKEN\"]  # from the secret store, never in the code\n"
"FINAL = {\"done\", \"failed\", \"canceled\"}\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class LabelError(Exception):\n"
"    def __init__(self, status, code, message):\n"
"        super().__init__(\"%s %s: %s\" % (status, code, message))\n"
"        self.status, self.code = status, code\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"session = requests.Session()\n"
"session.headers.update({\"Authorization\": \"Bearer \" + TOKEN, \"Accept-Language\": \"de-CH\"})\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def call(method, path, **kwargs):\n"
"    response = session.request(method, BASE + path, timeout=330, **kwargs)\n"
"    if response.status_code >= 400:\n"
"        try:\n"
"            error = response.json()[\"error\"]\n"
"        except (ValueError, KeyError):  # not from Tavletta, e.g. the proxy\n"
"            error = {\"code\": \"http_%d\" % response.status_code, \"message\": response.text}\n"
"        raise LabelError(response.status_code, error[\"code\"], error[\"message\"])\n"
"    return response\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def print_assets(numbers, printer=\"it-cab\", rows=None):\n"
"    \"\"\"One label per asset number, in one job; returns the finished job.\"\"\"\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"label\": \"asset-tag\",\n"
"        \"printer\": printer,\n"
"        \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": str(n)} for n in numbers],\n"
"        \"wait\": 30,\n"
"    }\n"
"    if rows:\n"
"        body[\"rows\"] = rows  # e.g. \"14-20\": only these rows\n"
"    for attempt in range(5):\n"
"        try:\n"
"            job = call(\"POST\", \"/print\", json=body).json()\n"
"            break\n"
"        except LabelError as e:\n"
"            # refused before it was queued: nothing printed, safe to retry\n"
"            if e.code not in (\"busy\", \"queue_full\") or attempt == 4:\n"
"                raise\n"
"            time.sleep(2**attempt)\n"
"    while job[\"state\"] not in FINAL:  # still printing after \"wait\"\n"
"        time.sleep(2)\n"
"        job = call(\"GET\", \"/jobs/\" + job[\"id\"]).json()\n"
"    return job\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def preview(number, path=\"preview.png\"):\n"
"    body = {\"label\": \"asset-tag\", \"data_rows\": [{\"AssetNumber\": str(number)}]}\n"
"    with open(path, \"wb\") as file:\n"
"        file.write(call(\"POST\", \"/preview\", json=body).content)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n"
"    preview(100001)\n"
"    numbers = range(100001, 100021)  # 20 labels\n"
"    job = print_assets(numbers)\n"
"    if job[\"state\"] == \"failed\":\n"
"        print(\"Stopped:\", job[\"error\"][\"message\"])\n"
"        # rows_printed rows are done: print the rest once the printer is fixed\n"
"        rest = \"%d-%d\" % (job[\"rows_printed\"] + 1, len(numbers))\n"
"        print(\"To continue:\", rest)\n"
"    else:\n"
"        print(job[\"state\"], job[\"printed\"], \"of\", job[\"total\"])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: C# and .NET { #csharp }"
msgstr "Exempel: C# och .NET { #csharp }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"With `HttpClient` and `System.Net.Http.Json` (.NET 8 or newer), as a console "
"program; in an application, register one `HttpClient` (for example with "
"`IHttpClientFactory`) and reuse it."
msgstr ""
"Med `HttpClient` och `System.Net.Http.Json` (.NET 8 eller senare), som ett "
"konsolprogram; i ett program registrerar du en enda `HttpClient` (till "
"exempel med `IHttpClientFactory`) och återanvänder den."

#. type: Fenced code block (csharp)
#: docs/api-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"using System.Net;\n"
"using System.Net.Http.Headers;\n"
"using System.Net.Http.Json;\n"
"using System.Text;\n"
"using System.Text.Json;\n"
"using System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n"
"\n"
"var baseUrl = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"TAVLETTA\") ?? \"https://labels.example.com/api/v1\";\n"
"var token = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"TAVLETTA_TOKEN\")!; // from the secret store\n"
"\n"
"using var http = new HttpClient { BaseAddress = new Uri(baseUrl.TrimEnd('/') + \"/\"), Timeout = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(330) };\n"
"http.DefaultRequestHeaders.Authorization = new AuthenticationHeaderValue(\"Bearer\", token);\n"
"http.DefaultRequestHeaders.AcceptLanguage.ParseAdd(\"de-CH\");\n"
"var labels = new LabelClient(http);\n"
"\n"
"var numbers = Enumerable.Range(100001, 20).Select(n => n.ToString()).ToList();\n"
"var job = await labels.PrintAssetsAsync(numbers, \"it-cab\");\n"
"Console.WriteLine(job.State == \"failed\"\n"
"    ? $\"Stopped: {job.Error?.Message} To continue: rows {job.RowsPrinted + 1}-{numbers.Count}\"\n"
"    : $\"{job.State}: {job.Printed} of {job.Total}\");\n"
"\n"
"public record ApiError(string Code, string Message);\n"
"public record ErrorBody(ApiError Error);\n"
"public record Job(\n"
"    string Id, string State, int Printed, int Total,\n"
"    [property: JsonPropertyName(\"rows_printed\")] int RowsPrinted, ApiError? Error);\n"
"\n"
"public class LabelException(HttpStatusCode status, string code, string message) : Exception(message)\n"
"{\n"
"    public HttpStatusCode Status { get; } = status;\n"
"    public string Code { get; } = code;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class LabelClient(HttpClient http)\n"
"{\n"
"    static readonly JsonSerializerOptions Json = new(JsonSerializerDefaults.Web);\n"
"\n"
"    public async Task<Job> PrintAssetsAsync(IList<string> assetNumbers, string printer, string? rows = null)\n"
"    {\n"
"        var body = new Dictionary<string, object>\n"
"        {\n"
"            [\"label\"] = \"asset-tag\",\n"
"            [\"printer\"] = printer,\n"
"            [\"data_rows\"] = assetNumbers.Select(n => new Dictionary<string, string> { [\"AssetNumber\"] = n }),\n"
"            [\"wait\"] = 30,\n"
"        };\n"
"        if (rows != null) body[\"rows\"] = rows; // e.g. \"14-20\"\n"
"        Job job;\n"
"        for (var attempt = 0; ; attempt++)\n"
"        {\n"
"            try { job = await SendAsync<Job>(HttpMethod.Post, \"print\", body); break; }\n"
"            catch (LabelException e) when (e.Code is \"busy\" or \"queue_full\" && attempt < 4)\n"
"            {\n"
"                await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Pow(2, attempt))); // nothing was printed\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"        while (job.State is \"queued\" or \"waiting\" or \"printing\")\n"
"        {\n"
"            await Task.Delay(2000);\n"
"            job = await SendAsync<Job>(HttpMethod.Get, $\"jobs/{job.Id}\");\n"
"        }\n"
"        return job;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public Task<Job> CancelAsync(string jobId) => SendAsync<Job>(HttpMethod.Delete, $\"jobs/{jobId}\");\n"
"\n"
"    async Task<T> SendAsync<T>(HttpMethod method, string path, object? body = null)\n"
"    {\n"
"        using var request = new HttpRequestMessage(method, path);\n"
"        // as a string: the server needs a Content-Length (JsonContent would send it chunked)\n"
"        if (body != null)\n"
"            request.Content = new StringContent(JsonSerializer.Serialize(body), Encoding.UTF8, \"application/json\");\n"
"        using var response = await http.SendAsync(request);\n"
"        if (!response.IsSuccessStatusCode)\n"
"        {\n"
"            ErrorBody? error = null;\n"
"            try { error = await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<ErrorBody>(Json); } catch (JsonException) { }\n"
"            throw new LabelException(response.StatusCode,\n"
"                error?.Error.Code ?? $\"http_{(int)response.StatusCode}\",\n"
"                error?.Error.Message ?? response.ReasonPhrase ?? \"\");\n"
"        }\n"
"        return (await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<T>(Json))!;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The base address ends with `/` and the paths have none at the start "
"(`\"print\"`, `\"jobs/…\"`): `HttpClient` then keeps `/api/v1`."
msgstr ""
"Basadressen slutar med `/` och sökvägarna har inget i början (`\"print\"`, "
"`\"jobs/…\"`): då behåller `HttpClient` `/api/v1`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api-guide.md
msgid ""
"The body goes as a `StringContent`: the server needs a `Content-Length`, and "
"`JsonContent.Create` would send the body in chunks without one (411 "
"`length_required`)."
msgstr ""
"Innehållet skickas som en `StringContent`: servern behöver en `Content-"
"Length`, och `JsonContent.Create` skulle skicka innehållet i delar utan en "
"sådan (411 `length_required`)."

#. type: Title #
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API-referens"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"The REST API of the print server (`tavletta serve`), for programs that print "
"labels: every request with its role, fields, answers and error codes. A "
"walkthrough for an inventory tool, with code in Python and C#, is "
"[Connecting an inventory tool](api-guide.md); installing the server is "
"[Server installation](server-install.md)."
msgstr ""
"REST-API:et för utskriftsservern (`tavletta serve`), för program som skriver "
"ut etiketter: varje förfrågan med sin roll, sina fält, svar och felkoder. En "
"genomgång för ett inventarieprogram, med kod i Python och C#, finns i "
"[Ansluta ett inventarieprogram](api-guide.md); hur servern installeras "
"beskrivs i [Serverinstallation](server-install.md)."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"This page is made from the OpenAPI 3.1 description of the server (`tools/"
"openapi_docs.py`). Programs and code generators read the same description: "
"`docs/openapi.yaml` in the source, or `GET /api/v1/openapi.json` from a "
"running server."
msgstr ""
"Den här sidan är genererad från serverns OpenAPI 3.1-beskrivning (`tools/"
"openapi_docs.py`). Program och kodgeneratorer läser samma beskrivning: `docs/"
"openapi.yaml` i källkoden, eller `GET /api/v1/openapi.json` från en körande "
"server."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basics { #basics }"
msgstr "Grunder { #basics }"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Address: `http://<server>:8790/api/v1`, or the HTTPS address of the reverse "
"proxy. The examples use `$TAVLETTA` for it and `$TOKEN` for the access token:"
msgstr ""
"Adress: `http://<server>:8790/api/v1`, eller HTTPS-adressen till den omvända "
"proxyn. Exemplen använder `$TAVLETTA` för den och `$TOKEN` för åtkomsttoken:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  TAVLETTA=https://labels.example.com/api/v1\n"
"  TOKEN=tav_0123456789ab_...\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"JSON in and out (UTF-8). Requests with a body need `Content-Type: "
"application/json` and a `Content-Length`."
msgstr ""
"JSON in och ut (UTF-8). Förfrågningar med innehåll kräver `Content-Type: "
"application/json` och en `Content-Length`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Every request but `GET /api/v1/health` needs the header `Authorization: "
"Bearer <token>`."
msgstr ""
"Varje förfrågan utom `GET /api/v1/health` kräver huvudet `Authorization: "
"Bearer <token>`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Messages come in the language of `Accept-Language` (e.g. `de-CH`), English "
"by default. Codes never change with the language: programs check the code, "
"people read the message."
msgstr ""
"Meddelanden kommer på språket i `Accept-Language` (t.ex. `de-CH`), som "
"standard engelska. Koderna ändras aldrig med språket: program kontrollerar "
"koden, människor läser meddelandet."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Unknown fields are refused (`unknown_field`): a typo never prints something "
"else than meant."
msgstr ""
"Okända fält avvisas (`unknown_field`): ett stavfel skriver aldrig ut något "
"annat än avsett."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roles { #roles }"
msgstr "Roller { #roles }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Each access token has a role (`tokens.toml`, made with `tavletta token "
"new`). A role may do what the roles above it may."
msgstr ""
"Varje åtkomsttoken har en roll (`tokens.toml`, skapad med `tavletta token "
"new`). En roll får göra det som rollerna ovanför den får göra."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role | May |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `preview` | list printers and labels, describe labels, previews, printer state, this description |\n"
"| `print` | as `preview`, and print; see and cancel its own jobs |\n"
"| `admin` | as `print`, and see and cancel every job |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Roll | Får |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `preview` | lista skrivare och etiketter, beskriva etiketter, förhandsgranska, skrivarstatus, den här beskrivningen |\n"
"| `print` | som `preview`, och skriva ut; se och avbryta sina egna jobb |\n"
"| `admin` | som `print`, och se och avbryta alla jobb |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"A token can be limited to some printers of `printers.toml`: the others are "
"then \"not found\" (404 `printer_not_found`) for it."
msgstr ""
"En token kan begränsas till vissa skrivare i `printers.toml`: de övriga är "
"då \"hittas inte\" (404 `printer_not_found`) för den."

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Errors { #errors }"
msgstr "Fel { #errors }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid "Every error is JSON with a stable code and a message for people:"
msgstr "Varje fel är JSON med en stabil kod och ett meddelande för människor:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "{\"error\": {\"code\": \"label_not_found\", \"message\": \"No such label: asset-tag.tavletta\"}}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status | Code | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 400 | `bad_request` | The request cannot be read (e.g. a body that ends early). |\n"
"| 400 | `not_json` | The body is no valid JSON (415 with another Content-Type). |\n"
"| 400 | `invalid_field` | A field has a wrong type or value; the message names it. |\n"
"| 400 | `unknown_field` | A field the request does not have (a typo): nothing is done. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_label` | Give either label or label_content. |\n"
"| 400 | `data_conflict` | Give data_rows or data_file, not both. |\n"
"| 400 | `data_column` | set names a `{placeholder}`: a data column, send it in data_rows. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_rows` | rows selects no data row. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_data` | sheet without a data file. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_printer` | Several printers and no default: name one in printer. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_host` | No printer address (without `printers.toml`). |\n"
"| 400 | `host_given` | host with `printers.toml`: choose the printer by name. |\n"
"| 400 | `too_many_copies` | More copies than the printer's max_copies. |\n"
"| 401 | `unauthorized` | Token missing, wrong, expired or revoked. |\n"
"| 403 | `forbidden` | The token's role is too low (e.g. preview printing). |\n"
"| 403 | `host_not_allowed` | The printer address is not allowed (`--allow-printer`). |\n"
"| 403 | `origin_not_allowed` | A web page of an origin not allowed (`--allow-origin`). |\n"
"| 403 | `header_required` | No token on the server: send X-Tavletta-Request. |\n"
"| 404 | `not_found` | No such path. |\n"
"| 404 | `label_not_found` | No such label file in the labels folder. |\n"
"| 404 | `data_not_found` | No such data file in the labels folder. |\n"
"| 404 | `printer_not_found` | No such printer, or one the token may not use. |\n"
"| 404 | `job_not_found` | No such job (another token's, or older than 24 hours). |\n"
"| 405 | `method_not_allowed` | Not a method of this path. |\n"
"| 408 | `timeout` | The request took longer than 30 s to send. |\n"
"| 409 | `job_finished` | The job has finished: nothing to cancel. |\n"
"| 409 | `counter_not_saved` | The label file is not writable: nothing was printed. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_exists` | A label of that name exists: upload with replace=true. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_in_use` | Jobs of the label wait or print: retry when they are done. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_changed` | The label file was replaced while the request was checked. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_locked` | A print of the label holds the file: retry when it has ended. |\n"
"| 411 | `length_required` | No Content-Length (chunked bodies are not accepted). |\n"
"| 413 | `too_large` | Body over `--max-body`, or too many data rows, columns or cells. |\n"
"| 413 | `too_many_labels` | Copies times rows over `--max-labels` (10000 by default); on label sheets over 999. |\n"
"| 413 | `label_too_large` | The label is too large to render (elements, text, pixels). |\n"
"| 415 | `not_json` | Send Content-Type: application/json. |\n"
"| 421 | `wrong_host` | A loopback server asked for another host name. |\n"
"| 422 | `file_problem` | The label file cannot be opened. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_not_label` | The file is no Tavletta label. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_newer` | The label needs a newer Tavletta: update the server. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_damaged` | The label file is damaged. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_unprintable` | It would print wrongly: a missing column, a bad code, … |\n"
"| 422 | `pages_not_allowed` | Document pages in label_content need the server switch `--allow-pdf-pages`. |\n"
"| 422 | `data_outside` | The label's data file lies outside the labels folder. |\n"
"| 422 | `data_problem` | The data file cannot be read, or has no such sheet. |\n"
"| 422 | `prepare_failed` | The label cannot be prepared for the printer. |\n"
"| 429 | `too_many_requests` | Ten wrong tokens from this address: wait a minute. |\n"
"| 429 | `queue_full` | Too many jobs waiting: retry later. |\n"
"| 500 | `internal` | An error of the server; it is logged. |\n"
"| 500 | `not_saved` | The labels folder could not be written (507: it is full). |\n"
"| 500 | `not_deleted` | The label file could not be deleted (a read-only folder). |\n"
"| 502 | `printer_<code>` | The printer is unreachable or reports a problem. |\n"
"| 503 | `busy` | All request or render slots taken: retry after a moment. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status | Kod | Betydelse |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| 400 | `bad_request` | Förfrågan går inte att läsa (t.ex. ett innehåll som tar slut för tidigt). |\n"
"| 400 | `not_json` | Innehållet är inte giltig JSON (415 med en annan Content-Type). |\n"
"| 400 | `invalid_field` | Ett fält har fel typ eller värde; meddelandet anger vilket. |\n"
"| 400 | `unknown_field` | Ett fält som förfrågan inte har (ett stavfel): ingenting görs. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_label` | Ange antingen label eller label_content. |\n"
"| 400 | `data_conflict` | Ange data_rows eller data_file, inte båda. |\n"
"| 400 | `data_column` | set anger en `{placeholder}`: en datakolumn, skicka den i data_rows. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_rows` | rows väljer ingen datarad. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_data` | sheet utan datafil. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_printer` | Flera skrivare och ingen standard: ange en i printer. |\n"
"| 400 | `no_host` | Ingen skrivaradress (utan `printers.toml`). |\n"
"| 400 | `host_given` | host med `printers.toml`: välj skrivare med namn. |\n"
"| 400 | `too_many_copies` | Fler kopior än skrivarens max_copies. |\n"
"| 401 | `unauthorized` | Token saknas, är felaktig, utgången eller återkallad. |\n"
"| 403 | `forbidden` | Tokens roll är för låg (t.ex. utskrift med preview). |\n"
"| 403 | `host_not_allowed` | Skrivaradressen är inte tillåten (`--allow-printer`). |\n"
"| 403 | `origin_not_allowed` | En webbsida från ett ursprung som inte är tillåtet (`--allow-origin`). |\n"
"| 403 | `header_required` | Ingen token på servern: skicka X-Tavletta-Request. |\n"
"| 404 | `not_found` | Ingen sådan sökväg. |\n"
"| 404 | `label_not_found` | Ingen sådan etikettfil i etikettmappen. |\n"
"| 404 | `data_not_found` | Ingen sådan datafil i etikettmappen. |\n"
"| 404 | `printer_not_found` | Ingen sådan skrivare, eller en som token inte får använda. |\n"
"| 404 | `job_not_found` | Inget sådant jobb (en annan tokens, eller äldre än 24 timmar). |\n"
"| 405 | `method_not_allowed` | Inte en metod för den här sökvägen. |\n"
"| 408 | `timeout` | Det tog längre än 30 s att skicka förfrågan. |\n"
"| 409 | `job_finished` | Jobbet är klart: ingenting att avbryta. |\n"
"| 409 | `counter_not_saved` | Etikettfilen är inte skrivbar: ingenting skrevs ut. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_exists` | Det finns redan en etikett med det namnet: ladda upp med replace=true. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_in_use` | Jobb för etiketten väntar eller skrivs ut: försök igen när de är klara. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_changed` | Etikettfilen ersattes medan begäran kontrollerades. |\n"
"| 409 | `label_locked` | En utskrift av etiketten håller filen: försök igen när den har avslutats. |\n"
"| 411 | `length_required` | Ingen Content-Length (innehåll i delar accepteras inte). |\n"
"| 413 | `too_large` | Innehåll över `--max-body`, eller för många datarader, kolumner eller celler. |\n"
"| 413 | `too_many_labels` | Kopior gånger rader över `--max-labels` (10000 som standard); på etikettark över 999. |\n"
"| 413 | `label_too_large` | Etiketten är för stor för att renderas (element, text, pixlar). |\n"
"| 415 | `not_json` | Skicka Content-Type: application/json. |\n"
"| 421 | `wrong_host` | En loopback-server blev tillfrågad om ett annat värdnamn. |\n"
"| 422 | `file_problem` | Etikettfilen kan inte öppnas. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_not_label` | Filen är ingen Tavletta-etikett. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_newer` | Etiketten kräver en nyare Tavletta: uppdatera servern. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_damaged` | Etikettfilen är skadad. |\n"
"| 422 | `label_unprintable` | Den skulle skrivas ut fel: en kolumn saknas, en felaktig kod, … |\n"
"| 422 | `pages_not_allowed` | Dokumentsidor i label_content kräver serverväljaren `--allow-pdf-pages`. |\n"
"| 422 | `data_outside` | Etikettens datafil ligger utanför etikettmappen. |\n"
"| 422 | `data_problem` | Datafilen kan inte läsas, eller har inget sådant blad. |\n"
"| 422 | `prepare_failed` | Etiketten kan inte förberedas för skrivaren. |\n"
"| 429 | `too_many_requests` | Tio felaktiga token från den här adressen: vänta en minut. |\n"
"| 429 | `queue_full` | För många jobb väntar: försök igen senare. |\n"
"| 500 | `internal` | Ett serverfel; det loggas. |\n"
"| 500 | `not_saved` | Det gick inte att skriva till etikettmappen (507: den är full). |\n"
"| 500 | `not_deleted` | Etikettfilen gick inte att ta bort (en skrivskyddad mapp). |\n"
"| 502 | `printer_<code>` | Skrivaren är onåbar eller rapporterar ett problem. |\n"
"| 503 | `busy` | Alla förfrågnings- eller renderingsplatser är upptagna: försök igen om en stund. |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`printer_<code>`: the printer's problem, one of `generic`, `not_found`, `timeout`, `stalled`, `port_closed`, `busy`, `paused`, `out_of_memory`, `cover_open`, `head_open`, `jam`, `media_jam`, `out_of_labels`, `out_of_paper`, `label_not_found`, `wrong_media`, `paper_size`, `page_too_large`, `too_long`, `too_wide`, `code_too_large`, `ribbon`, `ribbon_out`, `ribbon_direct`, `no_cassette`, `bad_cassette`, `supplies`, `format`, `resolution`, `queue_paused`, `job_held`, `job_canceled`, `usb_not_found`, `usb_permission`, `serial_permission`, `battery`, `overheat`, `unsupported_model`, `unknown_model`, `editor_lite`.\n"
msgstr "`printer_<code>`: skrivarens problem, ett av `generic`, `not_found`, `timeout`, `stalled`, `port_closed`, `busy`, `paused`, `out_of_memory`, `cover_open`, `head_open`, `jam`, `media_jam`, `out_of_labels`, `out_of_paper`, `label_not_found`, `wrong_media`, `paper_size`, `page_too_large`, `too_long`, `too_wide`, `code_too_large`, `ribbon`, `ribbon_out`, `ribbon_direct`, `no_cassette`, `bad_cassette`, `supplies`, `format`, `resolution`, `queue_paused`, `job_held`, `job_canceled`, `usb_not_found`, `usb_permission`, `serial_permission`, `battery`, `overheat`, `unsupported_model`, `unknown_model`, `editor_lite`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid "A job that fails tells why in its `error`, with these codes:"
msgstr "Ett jobb som misslyckas anger orsaken i sitt `error`, med dessa koder:"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Code | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `printer_<code>` | The printer is unreachable or reports a problem (jam, out of labels…). |\n"
"| `counter_not_saved` | Printed, but the next counter value could not be saved. |\n"
"| `label_locked` | Another print held the label file too long. |\n"
"| `prepare_failed` | The label could not be prepared for the printer. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kod | Betydelse |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `printer_<code>` | Skrivaren är onåbar eller rapporterar ett problem (papperskrock, slut på etiketter…). |\n"
"| `counter_not_saved` | Utskrivet, men nästa räknarvärde kunde inte sparas. |\n"
"| `label_locked` | En annan utskrift höll etikettfilen för länge. |\n"
"| `prepare_failed` | Etiketten kunde inte förberedas för skrivaren. |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limits { #limits }"
msgstr "Gränser { #limits }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| What | Limit |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Request body | 4 MB (`--max-body`) |\n"
"| Data rows, columns, cells | 100 000, 1000, 2 000 000 |\n"
"| One value or cell | 100 000 characters |\n"
"| Copies | 9999, or the printer's `max_copies` |\n"
"| Labels in one job (copies times rows) | 10 000 (`--max-labels`), on label sheets 999 |\n"
"| Elements of a label | 200, of them 50 images and codes; 5000 characters and 100 lines a text |\n"
"| Jobs waiting or printing | 100 in all, 20 per named token |\n"
"| Finished jobs kept | 24 hours, at most 1000 |\n"
"| `wait` | 300 seconds |\n"
"| Requests at once | 32, 8 per client address |\n"
"| Wrong tokens | 10 a minute per address, then 429 for a minute |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Vad | Gräns |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Förfrågans innehåll | 4 MB (`--max-body`) |\n"
"| Datarader, kolumner, celler | 100 000, 1000, 2 000 000 |\n"
"| Ett värde eller en cell | 100 000 tecken |\n"
"| Kopior | 9999, eller skrivarens `max_copies` |\n"
"| Etiketter i ett jobb (kopior gånger rader) | 10 000 (`--max-labels`), på etikettark 999 |\n"
"| Element i en etikett | 200, varav 50 bilder och koder; 5000 tecken och 100 rader per text |\n"
"| Jobb som väntar eller skrivs ut | 100 sammanlagt, 20 per namngiven token |\n"
"| Färdiga jobb som sparas | 24 timmar, högst 1000 |\n"
"| `wait` | 300 sekunder |\n"
"| Samtidiga förfrågningar | 32, 8 per klientadress |\n"
"| Felaktiga token | 10 per minut och adress, därefter 429 i en minut |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requests { #requests }"
msgstr "Förfrågningar { #requests }"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
msgid ""
"Besides the answers listed with each request, every request can get the "
"general errors of the table above: 401, 403, 405, 408, 421, 429 "
"(`too_many_requests`), 500 and 503, and one with a body 411, 413 "
"(`too_large`) and 415."
msgstr ""
"Förutom svaren som listas för varje förfrågan kan varje förfrågan få de "
"allmänna felen i tabellen ovan: 401, 403, 405, 408, 421, 429 "
"(`too_many_requests`), 500 och 503, och en med innehåll även 411, 413 "
"(`too_large`) och 415."

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Request | Role | What |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/health`](#get-health) | none | Is the server running; no token needed (for health checks) |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/openapi.json`](#get-openapi-json) | `preview` | This description (OpenAPI 3.1); a token of any role |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/me`](#get-me) | `preview` | The token's name, role and printers, and the limits of a request (for the web page) |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/printers`](#get-printers) | `preview` | The printers of `printers.toml` the token may use, with their state; without it the printer models, the address set for each and the printers found (`--discover`) |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/printers/{id}/status`](#get-printers-id-status) | `preview` | Ask a printer for its state: media, problems, resolution |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/labels`](#get-labels) | `preview` | The label files in the labels folder and its subfolders |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/labels/{name}`](#get-labels-name) | `preview` | What a label can be filled in with: elements, variables, data columns, size, counter |\n"
"| [`PUT /api/v1/labels/{name}`](#put-labels-name) | `admin` | Upload a label file (admin): checked as the app opens a file, then put into the labels folder in one step |\n"
"| [`DELETE /api/v1/labels/{name}`](#delete-labels-name) | `admin` | Delete a label file (admin); its data file stays |\n"
"| [`POST /api/v1/data`](#post-data) | `preview` | Read a data file sent along (CSV, ODS, XLSX) as the app reads one: its rows for data_rows; nothing is kept |\n"
"| [`POST /api/v1/preview`](#post-preview) | `preview` | The label filled in, as an image; nothing is printed |\n"
"| [`POST /api/v1/print`](#post-print) | `print` | Print: the request is checked, then queued; each printer prints one job at a time |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}`](#get-jobs-id) | `print` | State of a print job (a print token: its own jobs; admin: all). Kept 24 hours after it finished |\n"
"| [`DELETE /api/v1/jobs/{id}`](#delete-jobs-id) | `print` | Cancel a job: at once while it waits, after the labels already sent to the printer while it prints (cab: the job of up to labels_per_job labels) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Förfrågan | Roll | Vad |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/health`](#get-health) | ingen | Om servern körs; ingen token behövs (för hälsokontroller) |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/openapi.json`](#get-openapi-json) | `preview` | Den här beskrivningen (OpenAPI 3.1); en token med valfri roll |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/me`](#get-me) | `preview` | Tokenens namn, roll och skrivare samt gränserna för en begäran (för webbsidan) |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/printers`](#get-printers) | `preview` | De skrivare i `printers.toml` som token får använda, med sin status; utan den skrivarmodellerna, den inställda adressen för var och en och de hittade skrivarna (`--discover`) |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/printers/{id}/status`](#get-printers-id-status) | `preview` | Fråga en skrivare om dess status: material, problem, upplösning |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/labels`](#get-labels) | `preview` | Etikettfilerna i etikettmappen och dess undermappar |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/labels/{name}`](#get-labels-name) | `preview` | Vad en etikett kan fyllas i med: element, variabler, datakolumner, storlek, räknare |\n"
"| [`PUT /api/v1/labels/{name}`](#put-labels-name) | `admin` | Ladda upp en etikettfil (admin): kontrolleras som när appen öppnar en fil och läggs sedan i etikettmappen i ett enda steg |\n"
"| [`DELETE /api/v1/labels/{name}`](#delete-labels-name) | `admin` | Ta bort en etikettfil (admin); dess datafil finns kvar |\n"
"| [`POST /api/v1/data`](#post-data) | `preview` | Läs en medskickad datafil (CSV, ODS, XLSX) som appen läser den: dess rader för data_rows; inget sparas |\n"
"| [`POST /api/v1/preview`](#post-preview) | `preview` | Den ifyllda etiketten, som en bild; ingenting skrivs ut |\n"
"| [`POST /api/v1/print`](#post-print) | `print` | Skriv ut: förfrågan kontrolleras och köas sedan; varje skrivare skriver ut ett jobb i taget |\n"
"| [`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}`](#get-jobs-id) | `print` | Status för ett utskriftsjobb (en print-token: sina egna jobb; admin: alla). Sparas 24 timmar efter att det blivit klart |\n"
"| [`DELETE /api/v1/jobs/{id}`](#delete-jobs-id) | `print` | Avbryt ett jobb: omedelbart medan det väntar, efter de etiketter som redan skickats till skrivaren medan det skrivs ut (cab: jobbet på högst labels_per_job etiketter) |\n"

